# Everything under runs/ is LOCAL-ONLY and NOT tracked: the per-run outputs
# (TEST-PLAN / RESULTS-LOG / FIX-VERIFY-LOG under <target>-<date>/) regenerate each
# run, and the cross-run FINDINGS-LEDGER.md is local historical deep-reference (it
# persists on the dev box across runs, like the rest of the gitignored framework).
# Only this .gitignore stub is committed, to keep the dir present + carry this rule.
*
!.gitignore
